WEBVTT

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:20.100
Now is the time to take revenge on the Saiya-Jins

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.920
with our rage accumulated over the years.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.020
Don't let them fall of from our traps!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:35.720
Kill all of them! Do not leave out one single Saiyan!

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.500
Finally we can spread the blood of the Saiyans!

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:53.680
Surviving Saiyans on Earth you will get what you deserve

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:59.930
for the countless cold-blooded deeds that you have done in the past.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.560
This is the beginning of our revenge.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:07.680
Our rage is so deep to penetrate our bones.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:07.640
Goku! Breakfast is ready!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.310
Gohan, aren't you ready yet?

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:19.730
I have a feeling that today is going to be a good day again

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:24.070
Dad! Dad!

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:32.070
Gohan! Food is ready!

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.030
Dad, the woods are dying, look at these.

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:43.940
Really? I wonder what's going on?

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:47.140
ChiChi will be happy that we got firewood

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:51.340
Son Goku, we are in trouble!

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.380
Mr.Popo!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:02.310
The new Kami-sama told me that a gas called Destron Gas

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:05.930
is accumulating on Earth. It's not supposed to be here at all

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.610
Destron Gas?!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:13.130
Yes, it destroys all living cellular tissues.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:19.920
Dad, it might be the cause of the death of the woods.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:30.390
The new Kami-sama told me even lively beings like yourself

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:34.060
would die within seventy days.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.360
Seventy days?

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:38.730
Who is doing this?

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:44.090
Dad, it would be a good idea if we consult Ms. Bulma about these things.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.340
You're right.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:53.170
Goku, Gohan, your not going to eat?

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:12.800
Destron Gas, it's not in my data...

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:21.260
Ms. Bulma, please think of the way to detoxify the gas.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:26.590
Me and my father will look for the place where the gas is coming out.

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:32.670
OK. I still don't want to die, either.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:34.340
Right, Dad?

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:37.120
Yeah... Let's get on it right away.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:40.670
Good luck Bulma.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:46.220
Hey Popo... Where does that Destron Gas come from?

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:56.140
There are four places that Kami-sama told me to tell you to check out...

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:04.390
The first place is Grand Aaron, located southwest of the capital in the far east.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:12.990
The second one is near the pyramid in the desert far west of the northern capital

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:17.510
The third one is on the island with the Poco Poco volcano which has been erupting

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.940
for more than a hundred years in a desolate island in southern sea.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:23.340
And the fourth one is in the Land of Ice far up north.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.200
Do you understand, Son Goku?

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.250
Good, from here we'll look for them in two parties

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:34.960
Yes Dad!

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.060
Son, have you forgotten someone?

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.620
Piccolo san!

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:50.930
Piccolo! How did you find us?

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.370
Within me, there is the previous Kami-sama which has been existing before your time

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.510
I can see everything.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:00.560
That's great! Then I don't need to explain the whole story.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.950
Let's look for them in three parties!

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:04.650
But can you leave?

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.580
Who are you?

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:19.230
I'm sorry but we don't have time to play with you!!

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:26.230
Kamehame-Ha!

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:28.160
What the...?

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:38.110
Son! We've got no time to play!!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.510
One more time!

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:47.510
Kamehame-Ha

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:51.940
Dad!

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.420
Move it, Son!

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.940
Makankosappo!

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.620
Masenko!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:10.250
Why? Why can't we use our powers?!

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:20.600
This is because of the Destron Gas, you can't concentrate your Ki.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:26.720
Popo! While we are fighting, things are dying!

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.280
What...? What are they?

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:51.430
Everyone! We don't have much time!

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:55.620
Let's do it!

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:33.280
Something is coming out from here!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:13.490
So, this is the machine that generates the gas!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.340
I'm going to break you!

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.180
I won't let you do that, Saiyan!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:27.750
Who is it?

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:31.110
The monster that will kill you!

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.430
Are you the one who set this up?

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:43.430
Kamehame-Ha!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.160
Oh no!It's still not working!

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:07.920
I managed to beat it up.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.870
What the hell was that?

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:16.240
Anyway I have to destroy this one now!

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:42.310
The next target is the Land of Ice.

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:18.720
Just as my father said, my Ki is coming back up!!

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:33.400
Kamehame-Ha!

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.290
Yes! I did it!

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:44.460
I have to break the machine!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:41.560
Lands mines are set up around here!

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.400
Adios Piccolo!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:51.300
You are going to die without even touching the generator!!!

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.860
Land mines aren't a problem for me.

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.940
Can you come up here?

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.610
Yes I can!

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:48.870
What?

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.640
I never thought there would be someone stupider than Satan.

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:02.410
Anyway, I have to figure out where the others are

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:26.630
So this is what is called the permanent ice wall

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:29.400
This is the one?

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:33.100
What's a permanent ice wall?

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:38.220
It's an ice wall which will never melt away.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:45.510
I see, but we still have to break it down, Gohan

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:46.610
Yes!

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:50.590
Stop the useless effort!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:54.150
This place is going to be your graveyard!

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:05.280
Another small try

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:11.320
Go, let them freeze in the ice!

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:17.120
They'll never learn...

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:37.200
Son! Leave them to us!
You go ahead and take care of the wall!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.200
Dad!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:24.710
Damm! There are too many, no matter how many of them we kill!

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:25.520
Kakarotto

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.180
Looks like you're having a hard time...

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:33.560
Vegeta!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.940
Is everyone alright?

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.540
Trunks san!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.430
Do you hear about this from Bulma?

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.200
Yes Goku san!

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:45.050
Those things tried to attack me as a baby

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:47.920
and interfered with my mother's study

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:50.950
Are Bulma and the others alright?

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:54.360
Yes, me and my father rescued them and send them off.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:55.500
Trunks!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:58.340
How much longer are you going to chit chat?

00:16:59.270 --> 00:17:01.330
We have to take care of them first!

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:02.180
Yeah! Okay, let's go!

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:05.840
Let's go!

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.400
Now we destroyed all of them!

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.790
Now everything is alright!

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.270
Maybe I didn't have to show up

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:58.500
Goku san!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:02.770
Kami-sama, we did it!
We destroyed all the generators!

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:06.720
I'm afraid to tell you but Destron Gas is increasing more than before!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.920
What?

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:13.520
There was not only four of them...

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:18.040
Now another generator appeared in the western capital.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.180
Oh no! Where in the western capital?

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.000
Tongari Tower

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:28.480
Tongari Tower? Is the Destron Gas increasing as we speak?

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:29.650
Yes

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:48.150
That must be it

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:49.240
Leave it to me!

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:02.500
That's the end of that.

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:03.570
What?

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.680
It's impossible! Damn it!

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:16.050
You guys can't break that machine!
There's a barrier around it.

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:21.310
Fr...Freeza!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:29.490
I'm certain that I killed him with my own hands

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:33.610
You didn't die?

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.570
Ignorant Monkeys!

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:39.120
We will eradicate you all.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:41.790
We?

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:46.630
You Saiyans are going to be killed by us!!

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:48.160
What...!?

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:52.170
Freeza! Are you the one who is trying to spread the Destron Gas?

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:02.450
Today we will finally eradicate all of the Saiyans.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:03.550
Cooler!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:05.860
Tulece!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:13.120
I will let you enjoy the terror of the hell before I send you to the afterworld!!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.710
You are the shame of the Namek people!!

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:18.770
Piccolo, even if you are a Namekkian,

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:22.500
I will not hold back if you side with Saiyans!

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:26.270
If you change your mind now, I will let you go.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:31.070
We have to get rid of Saiyans this time!

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:34.380
What?

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:38.890
My hatred toward the Saiyans is the greatest,
can you understand my rage?

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:43.480
I, a Saiyan, was killed by a Saiyan!

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:45.580
What is this all about?

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:50.240
These are all the guys Dad beat!!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.370
I don't understand!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:01.760
Kid, don't worry...

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:06.020
I will send you to Heaven without much agony

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:12.140
Cooler! Take revenge on them as much as you please!

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.510
What are these guys?

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.220
A monkey who knows nothing but fighting...

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:22.700
Your execution will be left to me, Cooler!!

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:26.430
Vegeta! Your sins will never be forgiven!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:27.850
What tripe!

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:31.620
Slug! I'll take care of you!

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:44.780
You guys were killed miserably, you don't know how strong we are now!

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:49.720
You stupid fools, you won't be able to match up with us!

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:53.660
Vegeta, you became to be such a loudmouth!

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:56.330
You are the ones who are stupid fools!

00:21:57.930 --> 00:22:02.560
Our aim is to kill all the living Saiyans...

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:06.750
with the rage of those who were killed by you...

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:12.400
We will eradicate all the Saiyans from this world and send you to otherworld!

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:18.160
I would like to hear some words of appreciation since you don't have to suffer from the Destron Gas!

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:25.310
You are not Cooler!?

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:04.640
What...?

00:23:14.770 --> 00:23:18.500
Give them a beating beyond their imagination!

00:23:22.700 --> 00:23:25.790
It can't be... Its power is even greater than before!

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:32.800
What??

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:46.020
Is he a monster?

00:23:49.470 --> 00:23:51.500
Is it useless to beat these people up?

00:23:52.810 --> 00:23:54.020
That's right!

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:01.840
However many times you beat them, they keep coming back!!

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:08.600
What... What is this all about?

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:12.870
They're strong bastards!

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:15.680
What the hell is this all about?

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:18.590
Goku, they are ghost warriors

00:24:19.120 --> 00:24:19.980
Kaioh-sama

00:24:21.680 --> 00:24:23.180
That is to say, they are not real

00:24:24.070 --> 00:24:27.620
I got it! Now I know your true identity!!

00:24:30.570 --> 00:24:31.250
W... What?

00:24:31.710 --> 00:24:34.560
Everyone! These are ghost warriors!

00:24:40.880 --> 00:24:42.380
Disappear!!

00:24:52.440 --> 00:24:54.040
Piccolo san!

00:24:58.700 --> 00:25:00.970
No, don't!!!

00:25:10.690 --> 00:25:14.050
Looks like you have improved your fighting skills,

00:25:14.120 --> 00:25:17.360
but remember the power of our rage is far greater!!

00:25:19.250 --> 00:25:20.670
I wonder what they were really looking for...

00:25:21.170 --> 00:25:24.690
Piccolo san, we have to take care of this Destron Gas generator quickly.

00:25:24.690 --> 00:25:26.610
Goku san, what shall we do about this?

00:25:30.200 --> 00:25:33.180
Goku! Just as a saying aces "When in trouble, ask a God"

00:25:33.830 --> 00:25:35.780
Yes... kaioh-sama, please tell me!

00:25:37.110 --> 00:25:39.230
Listen well, Son Goku.

00:25:39.590 --> 00:25:44.340
To destroy the generator, you first have to attack the true being.

00:25:45.490 --> 00:25:46.160
True being?

00:25:47.410 --> 00:25:51.600
Find the true person who had Freeza attack you

00:25:51.780 --> 00:25:52.810
The true person?

00:25:53.690 --> 00:25:56.110
His name is Dr. Raichi

00:25:56.250 --> 00:26:01.840
He was the smartest among the scientifically advanced Tsufuru-jins

00:26:02.590 --> 00:26:03.690
Tsufuru-Jins?

00:26:04.690 --> 00:26:05.190
Tsufuru-Jins?

00:26:07.640 --> 00:26:12.260
Tsufuru-Jins! They are the ignorant race who were taken over by us Saiyans.

00:26:13.120 --> 00:26:15.500
Kaioh-sama, what is this all about?

00:26:15.570 --> 00:26:20.260
A long time ago Planet Vegeta used to be called Planet Plant

00:26:20.480 --> 00:26:25.030
and it was inhabited by Tsufuru-Jins who created a highly advanced scientific civilization.

00:26:25.880 --> 00:26:29.730
One day Saiyans arrived to the planet on a wrecked space ship

00:26:30.050 --> 00:26:32.560
and asked for help from the Tsufurus.

00:26:32.990 --> 00:26:36.650
Tsufurus allowed Saiyans to come down and settle on to their planet

00:26:36.650 --> 00:26:40.190
and the two races started to live together on the same planet.

00:26:41.100 --> 00:26:45.860
The Saiyan warrior race increases its number over the years and...one day

00:26:45.860 --> 00:26:51.590
a man was born with an extraordinary brain which was as good as a Tsufurus.

00:26:51.940 --> 00:26:55.020
the man, who was lately called King Vegeta,

00:26:55.120 --> 00:26:59.370
led the Saiyans to rebel against the Tsufurus.

00:26:59.970 --> 00:27:00.870
Ever since then

00:27:01.270 --> 00:27:05.290
the planet was renamed Planet Vegeta and Saiyans had become the rulers

00:27:05.670 --> 00:27:08.580
Saiyans did such a terrible thing... I didn't know!

00:27:08.870 --> 00:27:11.780
It was destiny that brought the Saiyan warrior race to the planet.

00:27:14.590 --> 00:27:17.250
Dad, I can understand the rage of Tsufuru-Jins,

00:27:17.680 --> 00:27:20.770
but that doesn't mean that they can kill everybody on the Earth.

00:27:22.240 --> 00:27:25.940
Kaioh-sama, where is this Raichi guy now?

00:27:26.820 --> 00:27:29.450
I heard that he was at the Dark Planet at the end of the Universe.

00:27:30.520 --> 00:27:31.870
Dark Planet?

00:27:36.670 --> 00:27:37.810
Okay! Let's go!

00:27:48.620 --> 00:27:53.060
Saiya-Jins, ghost warriors are just a greeting! Come here!

00:27:53.770 --> 00:27:58.860
I will have my revenge to my heart's content!

00:27:59.750 --> 00:28:06.890
However many times you beat the ghost warriors, they always come back!

00:28:07.190 --> 00:28:15.190
The intense rage towards Saiyans is waiting for Goku and the others!
